Package: pigoar2026
Title: Reproducible Analysis for the PIGO Annual Review 2026
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Tanu", "Kumar", email = "tkumar2@worldbankgroup.org", role = "aut"),
    person("Galileu", "Kim", email = "galileukim@worldbankgroup.org", role = "aut"),
    person("Ileana", "Marroquin", email = "imarroquinmartin@worldbankgroup.org", role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: Cleans, harmonizes, and analyzes public sector data to reproduce
    the figures and annex exhibits of the Public Institutions Global Observatory
    (PIGO) Annual Review 2026, providing a fully reproducible data pipeline.
